        text: "Monsoon travel may not be the refined, sun-soaked kind you plan for in advance. It is spontaneous, messy even, yet fun. So, grab a raincoat, skip the itinerary, and look for the version of India that only shows up when it’s pouring. This is your season, whether travelling with family or friends, or seeking solace in nature as a solo traveller.",
        page: 47
