    excerpt: "Healing, practically, means three things: lowering the background inflammation you are carrying, feeding the gut lining that does most of your immune work, and restoring the minerals stress and sweat drain out of you. Regular food items and spices in your kitchen do that quietly, cheaply, and without a subscription.",
