        type: "p",
        text: "After two decades of building nutrition plans for athletes, celebrities, and founders, I can tell you the fix is rarely exotic. It is usually two rows behind the dals, in a steel *dabba*. Every few months, a new superfood lands on our shelves with a price tag that could fund a weekend in Goa. I have nothing against them. But when I open a client’s cabinet, the genuinely repairing foods are already there.",
