        text: "Do not attempt all seven from Monday. Pick two. Run them for three weeks until they stop feeling like a project. Then add the next two. Every one of these will help, but real healing is deeply individual. Be sure of yourself: a food intolerance blood test, a functional medicine panel, a microbiome test, a genetic test. A qualified nutritionist or functional medicine doctor can then read those numbers and build you a blueprint that suits only you. One size does not fit all any more. Choose your nutrition the way you choose your shoes or your glasses – by what actually fits.",
