    excerpt: "In our series, we travel to various Indian destinations with a SpiceJet family member. This time, Pooja takes us around her home, Gwalior.",
    heroImage: "/images/stories/my-hometown-gwalior.webp",
    heroImageAlt: "The sandstone ramparts of Gwalior Fort",
    heroImageSource: "Spice Route - Sept 2026, PDF page 74",
