    category: "culture",
    author: "Arjun Kumar",
    date: "August 2026",
    excerpt: "In the eighth decade of our Independence, the story of India is not only told through technological innovation or entrepreneurial success. It is also written into the country’s infrastructure: the bridges that overcome impossible landscapes, the tunnels that conquer the toughest barriers; all making our travel easier and more memorable.",
