    author: "Bindu Gopal Rao",
    date: "August 2026",
    excerpt: "Coffee in India is getting a makeover that is all about specialities, exotic flavours, and spaces that are an ode to its artisanal journey.",
    heroImage: "/images/stories/from-estate-to-espresso.webp",
    heroImageAlt: "A cup of black coffee on a saucer, surrounded by roasted coffee beans",
    heroImageSource: "Spice Route - August 2026, PDF page 57",
