        text: "Begin your day before Pune awakes in one of the city’s most recognised spaces. Join joggers and devotees as you climb the stone steps up Parvati Hill, to watch the sun rise and the city emerge from the morning haze. Home to centuries-old temples, the hill offers panoramic views of Pune’s sprawling cityscape.",
