    author: "Manjulika Pramod",
    date: "July 2026",
    excerpt: "While frequent sightseeing trips and bucket-list driven itineraries have long dominated travel plans, a new trend has gained momentum, one that prioritises health, a robust metabolism, and age-focused regenerative therapies. Are you ready for Longevity Tourism?",
    heroImage: "/images/stories/live-long-travel-longer.webp",
