    author: "Deepesh Sharma",
    role: "Cabin Crew",
    date: "July 2026",
    excerpt: "In our series, we travel to various Indian destinations with a SpiceJet family member. This time, Deepesh takes us around his home town, Jaipur.",
    heroImage: "/images/stories/my-hometown-jaipur.webp",
