        text: "**Farzi Café**, Cyber Hub, introduces two menu experiences with the launch of its OG Menu and a new line-up of hero creations. The OG Menu celebrates timeless Indian flavours with dishes including Teen Mirch Paneer Tikka, Multani Paneer Tikka, Chicken Tikka, Mahi Tikka and Mutton Seekh Kebabs, followed by mains such as Paneer Darbari Mirchiwala, Pindi Choley, Malai Kofta Kaju Korma, Amritsari Kukkad Masala and Lal Maas Jodhpuri. The new hero dishes include the Avocado Masala Benne Taco and Masala Benne Taco, inspired by the comfort of the classic benne dosa and presented in a contemporary taco-style format. Together, the menu brings nostalgia and innovation to the table.",
