        text: "**Nandan Coffee** opens its first flagship at Embassy One on Bellary Road, Bengaluru, bringing the story of its origin into a new urban setting. Built on a three-generation legacy of single-estate, farm-to-cup coffee - the Bengaluru launch translates origin, craft and ritual into a coffee-focused experience. At the heart of the brand is the Nandanvan Estate in Kodaikanal, where certified organic coffee is grown within a biodiverse ecosystem. The space features an espresso bar with four roast profiles, manual brews including pour-over and French press, cold coffees on tap, and a dedicated Filter Kaapi Bar. Complementing the beverages is an all-day menu inspired by Kodaikanal and Mumbai.",
