    excerpt: "Pankaj Jha’s life as a painter and poet deeply influences his artistic voice and distinctive screen presence. Best known for his portrayal of Vidhayak Ji in ‘Panchayat’, we caught up with the NSD alumnus during his recent solo exhibition - Horizon, at Triveni Kala Sangam, Delhi.",
