        text: "Dinner at the Sterling V Grand Madurai is an experience in itself. Grand Ayyanar, the hotel’s multi-cuisine restaurant, serves authentic Madurai delicacies alongside Indian and global favourites. Guests can look forward to elaborate buffets, live counters and interactive kitchens, while savouring regional specialities such as Kari Dosa and Chettinad gravies. And for an evening under the stars, Upper Deck, with its rooftop poolside, promises alfresco seating, a live barbeque, panoramic city views, and a relaxing ambience",
