        type: "p",
        text: "The new language of relaxing is no longer a destination with a packed itinerary, rather a spa vacation that helps you slow down and relax well. And with SpiceJet providing convenient access across India, slipping away to the country’s best wellness hideouts has never been simpler. From beachside resorts to palace retreats and urban calm zones, these five destinations prove one thing clearly – holidays feel better when it comes with a great massage.",
