    date: "April 2026",
    excerpt: "Some places feel almost suspended in time. Even if you’ve been before, they keep calling out to you. SpiceJet’s leading summer destinations — Dharamshala, Jammu, Leh, Shillong and Srinagar — still hold a sense of discovery, and remain among the most sought-after hot-weather getaways. And here is your chance to plan in advance.",
