        type: "p",
        text: "In Srinagar, life unfolds around the magnificent Dal Lake. The chinars rise tall against the backdrop of the Zabarwan range, while the pristine Hazratbal shrine appears to float lightly on the water. **The Mughal-era Shalimar Bagh and Nishat Bagh stand as lasting testaments to the city’s layered past. Indeed, there is something about Srinagar — its light, its quietude — that imparts it an ethereal loveliness**.",
