    excerpt: "Five time Shark, and CEO & Co-founder of SUGAR Cosmetics, Vineeta Singh opens up about India’s thriving startup ecosystem, enduring beauty trends, and her impressive fitness regimen. Gearing up to run 42 kms on the Great Wall of China this May, she says staying fit has made her a better entrepreneur.",
    heroImage: "/images/stories/vineeta-singh-a-shark-of-all-times.webp",
